	<div class="creative-process" id="about">
		
		<div class="heading">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-md-6 text-center">
						<!--<h1>Indiana Powder Coatings</h1>
						<img src="img/brand.png" width="400" height="225" style="margin-top: -25px; margin-left: -36px;" alt="">-->
						<img src="img/brand.png" width="400" height=auto alt="">
						<!--<img src="img/brand.png" width="400" height="225" alt="">-->
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div><!-- end heading -->
		
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div id="carousel-creative-process" class="carousel slide">
				  <!-- Indicators -->
				  <ol class="carousel-indicators">
				    <li data-target="#carousel-creative-process" data-slide-to="0" class="active">About</li>
				    <li data-target="#carousel-creative-process" data-slide-to="1">Products</li>
				  </ol>

				  <!-- Wrapper for slides -->
				  <div class="carousel-inner">
				    <div class="item active text-center">
						<div class="row">
							<div class="col-md-6">
								<p><b>Coming soon!! A new option for your powder coating needs.</b></p>
								<ul class="custom">
									<li>Are you looking for a powder coatings partner, not just a supplier?</li>
									<li>Are you tired of being treated like you don't matter?</li>
									<li>Tired of poor customer service?</li>
									<li>Tired of being pushed to an &quot;on the shelf&quot; platform that may not meet all your needs?</li>
									<li>Tired of not knowing when your powder coating is going to hit your dock?</li>
									<li>Tired of endless price increases?</li>
									<li>Tired of excuses?</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							
							<div class="col-md-6">
								<h4>About</h4>
								
								<p>Then we may be just what you have been looking for. Indiana Powder Coatings is completing a manufacturing facility centrally located in the Midwest that is being built with brand new, state of the art, equipment. We can custom formulate virtually any chemistry powder coating to meet your needs. With our packaging systems we can package your custom formulated powder coating in any size container from a box, drum, tote, or super sack.</p>
							</div> 
						</div>
				    </div><!-- end item -->
					
				    <div class="item text-center">
						<div class="row">
							<div class="col-md-6">
								<img src="img/product.png"  width="500" height=auto alt="plan" class="hidden-xs" />
							</div>
							
							<div class="col-md-6">
								<h4>Products</h4>
								<p>We will be offering a variety of products to include (but not be limited to) powder coatings based on the following chemistries:</p>
								<ul class="custom">
									<li>Epoxy</li>
									<li>Hybrids</li>
									<li>TGIC</li>
									<li>HAA/TGIC-Free/Primid</li>
									<li>Urethane</li>
									<li>Fluoropolymer</li>
									<li>Acrylic</li>
								</ul>
							</div> 
						</div>
				    </div><!-- end item -->					
				  </div>
				</div><!-- end carousel -->
			</div>
		</div>
	</div><!-- end creative-process -->
	

